# Changes from plan v1 to v2

1 item added, 1 removed, 2 changed. 3 new messages, 1 no longer raised, 1 changed.

## Added

- `teams/PT1-ops` manual: Turn on Operations for Platform by hand

## Removed

- `users/PU4` create: Invite Drew Example

## Changed

- `users/PU3`: action (create, now skip), summary. Now: Casey Example is a stakeholder
- `teams/PT1`: depends_on. Now: Create team Platform

## New messages

- warning `users/PU3/stakeholder`: Casey Example is a PagerDuty stakeholder and is left out.
- manual task `teams/PT1-ops/enable_ops`: Open the team in JSM and turn on Operations.
- information `no_services`: The account has no services.

## No longer raised

- information `no_escalations`: The account has no escalation policies.

## Changed messages

